{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600130","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1260013001:1":{"text":"すべてが落ち着き、ラスティーアンカーの賛美の広場で、ソニアが民衆の前に姿を現した。","source_cn":"一切尘埃落定，锈锚港的颂神广场上，索尼娅清了清嗓子，向...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x785279F16A3A7157","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1260013002:1":{"text":"長ったらしい演説は苦手なので、手短に済まそうと思う。","source_cn":"各位，晚上好。我不擅长长篇大论，所以就简短地致辞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE86EC9B349EB96F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1260013003:1":{"text":"我々は、数々の危機を経験してきた。争い、欺瞞、貧困、暴力……それは外部からだけでなく、時に我々の中でも起きた。","source_cn":"我们过去曾经经历过无数次的危机，战斗、欺骗、贫穷、暴力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A01AB4D6AC84FC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260013004:1":{"text":"苦しい混乱の日々は、今もまだ、皆の記憶に新しいと思う。","source_cn":"那段痛苦而混乱的时光，对于大家而言，应该仍然记忆犹新。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7A179B81111FE4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1260013005:1":{"text":"だが、どんな荒波をも防ぐ堤防のように、ラスティーアンカーとここに住むあたしたちは、何者にも負けはしない。","source_cn":"然而，就像永远不会被海浪侵蚀的崖岸一样，锈锚港，以及我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE5B6481ACC5FE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_rec